@host = http://localhost:5067

### Dashboard KPIs
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard/summary

### Customer directory (search + paging)
GET {{host}}/api/customers?search=apex&page=1&pageSize=20

### One customer
GET {{host}}/api/customers/1

### Create customer (New Customer form)
POST {{host}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test Person",
  "email": "test.person@mail.example",
  "phone": "555-999-0000",
  "accountType": "individual",
  "company": ""
}

### Update customer
PUT {{host}}/api/customers/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Sarah Jenkins",
  "email": "sarah.jenkins@apexlogistics.example",
  "phone": "555-201-1001",
  "accountType": "business",
  "company": "Apex Logistics",
  "status": "Active"
}

### Customer deals
GET {{host}}/api/customers/1/deals

### Create deal
POST {{host}}/api/customers/1/deals
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Route optimisation", "value": 7500, "stage": "prospecting", "expectedCloseDate": "2026-12-31" }

### Open tasks due in the next week
GET {{host}}/api/tasks?status=open&dueBefore=2026-11-28

### Create task
POST {{host}}/api/customers/1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Call about route optimisation", "dueDate": "2026-11-25", "status": "open" }

### Customer interactions
GET {{host}}/api/customers/1/interactions

### Log interaction
POST {{host}}/api/customers/1/interactions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "call", "summary": "Quick check-in" }
